  "cited_article_id": "configure-automated-reminders",
  "reply": "You can review and adjust your reminder settings by going to **Settings > Communications > Reminders**, where you can set the dispatch window (24‑72 hours before the visit) and edit the SMS template. To check whether messages were sent, open **Reports > Message Log** and look for the delivery status of each reminder. Also verify that each patient’s profile has the communication opt‑in enabled."
}
